    "article": {
      "title": "Raptors Extend Shead Before Heat",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Rogers now owns Maple Leaf Sports and Entertainment outright, a clean business shift that matters most in this market because it touches the Leafs and Raptors under one roof. The Leafs are back in action Saturday night against the Senators at 7:00 PM ET on Sportsnet, while the Blue Jays are already into an unusual offseason and sorting out what comes next.",
        "For the Raptors, Jamal Shead has already been rewarded with a three-year extension, and the preseason rolls on Saturday against the Heat at 7:00 PM ET. The regular season opens October 21 against the Bulls at 7:30 PM ET.",
        "In Washington, the Commanders head to Indianapolis on Sunday morning for a 9:30 AM ET meeting with the Colts on NFL Net, with both teams carrying exactly the kind of early-season pressure that can sharpen a fall weekend."
      ]
    }
  }
